Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- 查询某天所有排班（含医生信息）----
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/detail?workDate=2026-03-24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新医生费用（需要 token）
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/update/fee?doctorId=11&fee=160.00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 无 token 访问（应返回 401）
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/search/online

### ==================== 订单服务 ====================

### 步骤1：查询病人列表，复制目标病人的 id 填入下方patientId
GET {{gateway}}/user/patient/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 步骤2：查询某天排班，复制目标排班的 scheduleId 填入下方scheduleId
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/schedule/detail?workDate=2026-03-24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 步骤3：创建订单
POST {{gateway}}/order/create?patientId=5035529022412894814&scheduleId=6663067118905523115&workDate=2026-03-24
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 步骤4：查询当前用户订单列表，确认创建成功，复制 id 填入下方
GET {{gateway}}/order/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 步骤5：查询订单详情（用上方列表中的订单 id）
GET {{gateway}}/order/detail?orderId=5934395337055932455
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
